/*
 * Coordinate a loading operation across the browser and its workers.
 *
 * Start/end handlers update Stop, the globe, progress and busy/input state.
 * Abort stops parsing, fetching and importing and tells the affected frames
 * to stop. Quit and detach can be deferred until pending work completes,
 * so worker callbacks do not outlive the objects they use. The fetch/import
 * engines manage their own queues and release individual request resources.
 * HTMLView.goc registers these application handlers.
 */

